===== Modem configuration =====

-> [[:docs:guide-user:network:wan:wwan:ltedongle|How to use LTE modem in QMI mode for WAN connection]]

The standard configuration can be used, but DHCP (for IPv4) should be disabled, either in Luci or in the configuration file (''/etc/config/network''):

<code>
config interface 'wwan'
        option proto 'qmi'
        option device '/dev/cdc-wdm0'
        option apn 'internet'
        option pdptype 'ip'
        option dhcp '0'
</code>

